---
description: Keep route types and Drizzle migrations in the same change
globs: apps/web/app/routes/**,packages/db/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Routes and schema

When you add or rename a route module under `apps/web/app/routes/`, run `pnpm run typegen` (included in `pnpm run typecheck`). Commit generated route types with the PR.

When you change Drizzle schema under `packages/db/`:

1. `pnpm run db:generate`
2. `pnpm run db:migrate:local`
3. Include the new migration SQL in the PR and mention it in the description.

Do not run remote migrations from a feature PR. JSON APIs are `api.*.ts` route modules that call `handleApiRoute` + a handler in `apps/web/server/api/`.
